Roberto A. Stempniak, Sociedade Brasileira de Vácuo, 2002. *A ciência e a tecnologia do vácuo: resumo histórico e algumas aplicações*. [Society-hosted Portuguese introduction](https://www.sbvacuo.org.br/noticias/o-que-e-vacuo.pdf), 14 pages.

Read the short introduction as an optional Portuguese entrance to pressure, pumping and the uses of vacuum. Compare its general historical narrative with the direct physical explanations and later technical books. It is introductory outreach, not a complete engineering text.

The web reader exposed the title, presentation and introductory pressure/pumping passages on 30 October 2026, while direct file retrieval returned 404. Access may therefore fail through another client; the Leybold and Al-Dmour readings provide the technical route independently. No open adaptation licence was verified. Keep the source external and do not reproduce its historical claims as established scholarship without checking their original evidence.

